# CNS LINE OA

LINE HMAC webhook → Firestore profile → one `resolveCommandReply` → Flex.
Do not add a second router. Do not put LINE events on GraphQL. Do not store users or Odoo data in Mongo.

Admin chain (fail closed): LINE id → profile → `odooVerified` → `ADMIN_USER_ID` → Odoo admin capability → `role=admin`.

## Environments

| `APP_ENV` | Host | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `development` | laptop | Local + `/webhook-test` + `/demo` |
| `staging` | Railway | Demo; set ENABLE_* flags; `NODE_ENV=production` |
| `production` | final delivery | Demo and webhook-test off even if ENABLE_* is set |

Unset `APP_ENV` with `NODE_ENV=production` is treated as production.

Optional adapters (Swagger, GraphQL, Mongo RAG, BullMQ) are ops add-ons, not the bot.

